---@field domain_scope? posthog.organizations.CreateIdentityProviderConfigRequestDomainScope|distilled.Null Domains this configuration applies to. An unset value behaves like selected domains. * `all` - All * `selected` - Selected
---@field config_scope? posthog.organizations.CreateIdentityProviderConfigRequestConfigScope|distilled.Null Feature configured by this identity provider configuration. * `saml` - Saml * `oidc` - Oidc * `scim` - Scim * `xaa` - Xaa
---@field organization_domain_ids? posthog.organizations.CreateIdentityProviderConfigRequestOrganizationDomainIdsList Organization domain IDs that this identity provider configuration applies to.
---@field oidc_issuer_url? string HTTPS issuer URL. Must exactly match the issuer in the OIDC discovery document.
---@field oidc_client_id? string Client ID of the organization's OIDC application.
---@field oidc_client_secret? string|distilled.Secret OIDC client secret. Omit to keep the saved secret. Set to an empty string to remove it. Never returned in responses.
---@field saml_entity_id? string|distilled.Null SAML IdP entity ID (issuer).
---@field saml_acs_url? string|distilled.Null SAML single sign-on (ACS) URL the IdP redirects to.
---@field saml_x509_cert? string|distilled.Null SAML IdP X.509 signing certificate (PEM).
---@field scim_enabled? boolean Whether SCIM provisioning is enabled. Setting this true generates a bearer token (returned once); setting it false clears the token.
---@field id_jag_issuer_url? string|distilled.Null Trusted IdP issuer URL for ID-JAG (XAA). Required to enable ID-JAG.
---@field id_jag_jwks_url? string|distilled.Null Override JWKS URL. Defaults to OIDC discovery on the issuer URL.
---@field id_jag_allowed_clients? posthog.organizations.CreateIdentityProviderConfigRequestIdJagAllowedClientsList Allowed ID-JAG client IDs. Empty list allows any client_id.

---Feature configured by this identity provider configuration.
---
---* `saml` - Saml
---* `oidc` - Oidc
---* `scim` - Scim
---* `xaa` - Xaa
---@alias posthog.organizations.CreateIdentityProviderConfigRequestConfigScope posthog.organizations.ConfigScopeEnum|string|posthog.organizations.BlankEnum|string

---Domains this configuration applies to. An unset value behaves like selected domains.
---
---* `all` - All
---* `selected` - Selected
---@alias posthog.organizations.CreateIdentityProviderConfigRequestDomainScope posthog.organizations.DomainScopeEnum|string|posthog.organizations.BlankEnum|string

---Allowed ID-JAG client IDs. Empty list allows any client_id.
---@alias posthog.organizations.CreateIdentityProviderConfigRequestIdJagAllowedClientsList string[]

---Organization domain IDs that this identity provider configuration applies to.
---@alias posthog.organizations.CreateIdentityProviderConfigRequestOrganizationDomainIdsList string[]

