---@field tracing_session_id_attribute_keys posthog.organizations.TeamTracingConfigTracingSessionIdAttributeKeysList Ordered list of span or resource attribute keys whose values hold the PostHog session ID. Detection checks keys in order, then falls back to common session ID attribute conventions; the first key with a value wins. Defaults to ['sessionId'], the key the posthog-js / posthog-react-native SDKs attach to the OTel signals they emit. Add keys only if your pipeline emits the session ID under different attributes.
---@field retention_days? number How long spans are kept before they are deleted, in days. Applied at ingest, so a change only affects spans received after it. Can be changed at most once per 24 hours. Span retention rules override this period for the spans they match.
