---@class posthog.organizations.Trial
---@field type string
---@field status string
---@field target string
---@field expires_at string|distilled.Null

---@class posthog.organizations.UpdateCimdVerificationTokensPartialRequest
---@field organization_id string ID of the organization you're trying to access. To find the ID of the organization, make a call to /api/organizations/.
---@field id string A UUID string identifying this CIMD Verification Token.
---@field cimd_url? string HTTPS URL of the CIMD metadata document to bind this token to. Only settable once, on a token with no existing binding; an already-bound token must be reissued instead.

---@class posthog.organizations.UpdateCrossProjectDashboardsPartialRequest
---@field organization_id string ID of the organization you're trying to access. To find the ID of the organization, make a call to /api/organizations/.
---@field id string Id of the dashboard.
---@field name? string Name shown in the dashboard list and page header.
---@field description? string Optional longer description.
---@field filters? any Dashboard-level filters applied to every tile. Supports a date range, an interval, and property filters that refer to a property by name. Filters carrying a project-specific id are rejected.

---@class posthog.organizations.UpdateCrossProjectDashboardsTilesPartialRequest
---@field organization_id string ID of the organization you're trying to access. To find the ID of the organization, make a call to /api/organizations/.
---@field dashboard_id string Id of the dashboard.
---@field id string Id of the tile.
---@field layouts? any Grid position and size of the tile, keyed by layout size.
---@field color? string|distilled.Null Optional color applied to the tile.
---@field filters_overrides? any Filters applied to this tile only, overriding the dashboard's. Supports a date range and an interval. Filters carrying a project-specific id are rejected.

---@class posthog.organizations.UpdateDomainRequest
---@field organization_id string ID of the organization you're trying to access. To find the ID of the organization, make a call to /api/organizations/.
---@field id string A UUID string identifying this domain.
---@field domain? string
---@field jit_provisioning_enabled? boolean
---@field sso_enforcement? string

---@class posthog.organizations.UpdateDomainsPartialRequest
---@field organization_id string ID of the organization you're trying to access. To find the ID of the organization, make a call to /api/organizations/.
---@field id string A UUID string identifying this domain.
---@field domain? string
---@field jit_provisioning_enabled? boolean
---@field sso_enforcement? string

---@class posthog.organizations.UpdateIdentityProviderConfigRequest
---@field organization_id string ID of the organization you're trying to access. To find the ID of the organization, make a call to /api/organizations/.
---@field id string A UUID string identifying this identity provider config.
---@field name? string Display name for this IdP configuration (e.g. 'Okta production').
---@field domain_scope? posthog.organizations.UpdateIdentityProviderConfigRequestDomainScope|distilled.Null Domains this configuration applies to. An unset value behaves like selected domains. * `all` - All * `selected` - Selected
---@field config_scope? posthog.organizations.UpdateIdentityProviderConfigRequestConfigScope|distilled.Null Feature configured by this identity provider configuration. * `saml` - Saml * `oidc` - Oidc * `scim` - Scim * `xaa` - Xaa
---@field organization_domain_ids? posthog.organizations.UpdateIdentityProviderConfigRequestOrganizationDomainIdsList Organization domain IDs that this identity provider configuration applies to.
---@field oidc_issuer_url? string HTTPS issuer URL. Must exactly match the issuer in the OIDC discovery document.
---@field oidc_client_id? string Client ID of the organization's OIDC application.
---@field oidc_client_secret? string|distilled.Secret OIDC client secret. Omit to keep the saved secret. Set to an empty string to remove it. Never returned in responses.
---@field saml_entity_id? string|distilled.Null SAML IdP entity ID (issuer).
---@field saml_acs_url? string|distilled.Null SAML single sign-on (ACS) URL the IdP redirects to.
---@field saml_x509_cert? string|distilled.Null SAML IdP X.509 signing certificate (PEM).
---@field scim_enabled? boolean Whether SCIM provisioning is enabled. Setting this true generates a bearer token (returned once); setting it false clears the token.
---@field id_jag_issuer_url? string|distilled.Null Trusted IdP issuer URL for ID-JAG (XAA). Required to enable ID-JAG.
---@field id_jag_jwks_url? string|distilled.Null Override JWKS URL. Defaults to OIDC discovery on the issuer URL.
---@field id_jag_allowed_clients? posthog.organizations.UpdateIdentityProviderConfigRequestIdJagAllowedClientsList Allowed ID-JAG client IDs. Empty list allows any client_id.

---Feature configured by this identity provider configuration.
---
---* `saml` - Saml
---* `oidc` - Oidc
---* `scim` - Scim
---* `xaa` - Xaa
---@alias posthog.organizations.UpdateIdentityProviderConfigRequestConfigScope posthog.organizations.ConfigScopeEnum|string|posthog.organizations.BlankEnum|string

---Domains this configuration applies to. An unset value behaves like selected domains.
---
---* `all` - All
---* `selected` - Selected
---@alias posthog.organizations.UpdateIdentityProviderConfigRequestDomainScope posthog.organizations.DomainScopeEnum|string|posthog.organizations.BlankEnum|string

---Allowed ID-JAG client IDs. Empty list allows any client_id.
---@alias posthog.organizations.UpdateIdentityProviderConfigRequestIdJagAllowedClientsList string[]

---Organization domain IDs that this identity provider configuration applies to.
---@alias posthog.organizations.UpdateIdentityProviderConfigRequestOrganizationDomainIdsList string[]

