---@field autocapture_opt_out? boolean|distilled.Null Disables posthog-js autocapture (clicks, page views) when true.
---@field autocapture_exceptions_opt_in? boolean|distilled.Null Enables automatic capture of JavaScript exceptions via the SDK.
---@field autocapture_web_vitals_opt_in? boolean|distilled.Null Enables automatic capture of Core Web Vitals performance metrics.
---@field autocapture_web_vitals_allowed_metrics? any
---@field autocapture_exceptions_errors_to_ignore? any
---@field capture_console_log_opt_in? boolean|distilled.Null Enables capturing browser console logs alongside session replays.
---@field capture_performance_opt_in? boolean|distilled.Null Enables capturing performance timing and network requests.
---@field session_recording_opt_in? boolean Enables session replay recording for this project.
---@field session_recording_sample_rate? string|distilled.Null Fraction of sessions to record, as a decimal string between `0.00` and `1.00` (e.g. `0.1` = 10%).
---@field session_recording_minimum_duration_milliseconds? number|distilled.Null Skip saving sessions shorter than this many milliseconds.
---@field session_recording_linked_flag? any
---@field session_recording_network_payload_capture_config? any
---@field session_recording_masking_config? any
---@field session_recording_url_trigger_config? posthog.organizations.UpdateOrganizationsProjectsDefaultReleaseConditionRequestSessionRecordingUrlTriggerConfigList|distilled.Null
