---@field session_recording_trigger_match_type_config? string|distilled.Null
---@field session_recording_trigger_groups? any V2 trigger groups configuration for session recording. If present, takes precedence over legacy trigger fields.
---@field session_recording_retention_period? posthog.organizations.SessionRecordingRetentionPeriodEnum|string How long to retain new session recordings. One of `30d`, `90d`, `1y`, or `5y` (availability depends on plan). * `30d` - 30 Days * `90d` - 90 Days * `1y` - 1 Year * `5y` - 5 Years
---@field session_replay_config? any
---@field survey_config? any
---@field access_control? boolean
---@field week_start_day? posthog.organizations.WeekStartDayEnum|number|distilled.Null First day of the week for date range filters. 0 = Sunday, 1 = Monday. * `0` - Sunday * `1` - Monday
